items.description:
Computations for Bessel function for complex, real and partly 'mpfr'
(arbitrary precision) numbers; notably interfacing TOMS 644;
approximations for large arguments, experiments, etc.

Three unrelated packages: DB_process, to parse and process database output;
CD_labeler, to typeset user text to fit on a CD label; and repeat, a nestable,
generic loop macro.
